// RUN: %diff "%s.expect" "%t"

// https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/317: with --trait-rank-decreases, the values of a trait that is not a
// reference type are ordered by structural rank with inductive datatypes and sequences, and with
// --additional-axioms a trait-typed field of an inductive datatype value is below that value.  The fixtures are
// in Inputs/github-issue-317-*.dfy; docs/dev/design/317-datatype-trait-decreases.md has the soundness argument.
// The legacy resolver does not accept these programs (datatypes extending traits), so only the refreshed one runs.
